&lt;p&gt;Currently in master branch code is slightly changed, but NPE also can happen during tx initialization in &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1, 2&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
It happens, when &lt;tt&gt;IgniteTxManager#onCreate&lt;/tt&gt; returns null &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;3&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; and in turn &lt;tt&gt;IgniteTxManager#newTx&lt;/tt&gt; returns null too &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;4&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
It can be caused by JVM pause in the middle of &lt;tt&gt;IgniteTxManager#newTx&lt;/tt&gt; execution.&lt;/p&gt;


